Distinct-name partial-permutation unrank-ന്റെ remaining-list ordinal -> original canonical ordinal mapping fixed first/eighth probes-ിൽ നിന്ന് dynamic removal-count helper ആയി ഉയർത്തുന്ന clean Stage 1 probe. input: removalCount, remainingOrdinal, തുടർന്ന് removed original ordinals descending order-ൽ. removed values Hamlet-ന്റെ stack-ൽ push ചെയ്യുന്നു; recall അവയെ ascending order-ൽ നൽകുന്നു. ഓരോ removed ordinal current candidate-നെ കവിയാത്തപ്പോൾ candidate ഒന്നുകൂടി നീക്കുന്നു. removed set-ന്റെ semantic order പ്രസക്തമല്ല; ഈ helper sorted set representation മാത്രം ഉപയോഗിക്കുന്നു. output original canonical ordinal.

Hamlet, removed ordinal-ുകളുടെ stackയും current recalled removal-ും സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, removal count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, remaining-list ordinal സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, original ordinal candidate സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, read/process counter സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, input, flow, output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: dynamic input and stack materialization.

Scene I: removal count and remaining ordinal.
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Othello]
Romeo: You are as good as myself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: read exactly removalCount ordinals in descending order and remember each.
[Enter Macbeth and Juliet]
Macbeth: Am I as good as Juliet?
Juliet: If so, let us proceed to act II.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Listen to your heart. Remember yourself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero. Let us return to scene II.
[Exeunt]

Act II: recall ascending removals and shift candidate.

Scene I: reset process counter.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are nothing.

Scene II: all removals processed.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Macbeth and Juliet]
Macbeth: Am I as good as Juliet?
Juliet: If so, let us proceed to act III.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: recall next smallest removed ordinal.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Recall your newest memory.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: removed current candidate-നെക്കാൾ വലുതാണെങ്കിൽ shift വേണ്ട; അല്ലെങ്കിൽ candidate increment ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Enter Hamlet and Othello]
Hamlet: Am I better than Othello?
Othello: If so, let us proceed to scene VI.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.

Scene VI: next removal.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero. Let us return to scene II.
[Exeunt]

Act III: result.

Scene I: original canonical ordinal.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
